  id: void_manipulator
  displayName: Void Manipulator
  description: Endgame Channeler. In an abyssal void node, manipulates gravity, space,
    and time.
  tier: 1
  family: 3
  behaviors:
  - Player gravity reverses unpredictably.
  - "Boss has 3 positions at once \u2014 must be hit in all 3 to do real damage."
  - "Time slows in pockets \u2014 must read which 'speed bubble' she's in."
  - 'Final phase: arena unfolds into non-Euclidean shape, gravity vectors confuse
    aim.'
  abilities:
  - "Gravity Flip \u2014 temporary reversal"
  - "Triple Self \u2014 exists in 3 places"
  - "Time Pocket \u2014 slow-motion bubble"
  - "Reality Fold \u2014 final phase, arena becomes non-Euclidean"
  dropItemIds:
  - Void Manipulator's Sigil (singularity gear)
  - Aether Distillate x3
  - Heart Fragment (1 of 7)
  - Spirit Anchor (an original Kin Council theorist)
  boss_section: Channeler Family
  isBoss: 1
  isFinale: 0
  baseHealth: 30
  baseSpeed: 4
